WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — jouleos (90s) Narrator Bobby

1
00:00:01.495 --> 00:00:07.185
Wall-clock quotas treat a quiet sleep and a full tensor-core burst identically,

2
00:00:07.185 --> 00:00:10.642
leaving agent sandboxes blind to physical power.

3
00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:21.701
When one pipeline stage has rail-shunt measured_j and another has analytical est_j,

4
00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:26.432
the 78,400-pair meet operator labels the sum honestly.

5
00:00:30.219 --> 00:00:36.838
This three-dimensional hardware-software stack traces rail telemetry up

6
00:00:36.838 --> 00:00:42.059
through SATB-IO drift gates into Ed25519 JCR-1 receipts.

7
00:00:45.846 --> 00:00:48.950
Child holds cannot exceed parent grants,

8
00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:55.935
settlements reconcile exact remainders, and noisy shared-host windows withhold net splits.

9
00:00:59.721 --> 00:01:05.353
All 310 Rust workspace tests pass cleanly across receipt serialization,

10
00:01:05.353 --> 00:01:09.239
signature tampering rejection, and stage rollups.

11
00:01:13.026 --> 00:01:19.355
By separating what today's OSes lack from what the verified Rust spine already checks,

12
00:01:19.355 --> 00:01:22.078
JouleOS charts a concrete build path.
